It reads your entire codebase in minutes, including what you thought was hidden.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:15,000
An AI agent reads file after file. Humans can't review at machine speed, so leaks are silent.

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:20,000
One command locks your code in place: ailatch lock.

5
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:29,000
Same file, two realities. You see plaintext. The AI sees only noise.

6
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:37,000
Same app, two ways to run it. python app.py and ailatch run app.py give identical results, but an LLM reading the locked file only sees ciphertext.

7
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:45,000
Built like a vault: ChaCha20-Poly1305 encryption, Argon2id keys, transparent imports and file I/O, a GUI editor, recovery keys.

8
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:55,500
AILatch. Latch it. Run it. Ship it. Information locked, code visible and runnable. pip install ailatch. Python 3.11 and up.
